@startuml
title State Diagram - BPO Management System Scenario 2

[*] --> Idle : Initial state

state Idle
state FilterSelection
state SearchResults
state NoMatchingResults

Idle --> FilterSelection : User Interaction Event

FilterSelection --> SearchResults : Search Criteria Event

SearchResults --> NoMatchingResults : No users match the selected criteria

NoMatchingResults --> [*] : Final state
@enduml
